==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
<WRAP BOX>
VLAN (802.1q) devices can be configured at the br-lan bridge device. The ASUS RT-AX54 uses the new DSA switch configuration:
 
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| WAN (blue)       | wan      |
| LAN 1            | lan1     |
| LAN 2            | lan2     |
| LAN 3            | lan3     |
| LAN 4            | lan4     |

</WRAP>

