==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!


  - unscrew two screws that are sitting below the rubber feet casings and two screws near the antennas.One of the screws has a warranty sticker sticked on top of it.
  - use a metal pry tool and start opening form the lower part of the bottom casing (on the same side of the LEDs), slide the plier carefully around the unit in order to remove the top cover
  - you now have access to the pcb and can move onto the soldering part

